BwnZny1lkqOXuiBSqzQ&oe=6A4CEA91"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Weather Now", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Weather Now turns your Meta Quest into the most relaxing way to check the **forecast**. Get accurate, real-time conditions, detailed hourly and **10-day forecasts**, animated **radar**, and severe weather **alerts** \u2014 all in a clean, comfortable VR interface designed for quick daily check-ins.\n\n# FEATURES\n- **Current conditions** with temperature, \"feels like,\" humidity, wind, UV index, and air quality\n- Hour-by-hour forecasts for the next 24 hours\n- 10-day extended outlook with highs, lows, and precipitation chances\n- Animated **weather** radar so you can watch fronts and storms move\n- Severe weather alerts for your saved locations\n- Sunrise, sunset, and moon-phase data\n- Search and save unlimited locations worldwide\n- Imperial or metric units\n\n# DESIGNED FOR QUEST\n- Comfortable, low-motion UI \u2014 safe for any user\n- Crisp text and high-contrast layouts optimized for VR readability\n- Quick-launch shortcuts so you can check the forecast in seconds\n- Works seated, standing, or in any play area\n\nWhether you're planning your day, tracking incoming **storms**, or just enjoying a moment with the sky around you, Weather gives you the information you need at a glance. No ads cluttering your view. No motion sickness. Just clear forecasts, anywhere in the world.\n\nFree to download. Open it in the morning, before a session, or whenever you want to know what the sky is doing.", "short_description": "Step into your forecast. Weather brings real-time conditions, hourly and 10-day forecasts, severe alerts, and interactive radar to Meta Quest in a clear, comfortable VR view. Check the sky for your location, watch storms move in on the radar, and stay ahead of changing conditions \u2014 all without leaving your headset. Lightweight, fast, and built for at-a-glance updates between sessions or as your daily morning check-in."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://weathernowquest.com/legal/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://weathernowquest.com/legal/terms", "publisher_name": "Eightpoint Technologies Ltd SEZC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://weathernowquest.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26691746200486058"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1251574240068756"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1251574240068756"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1778869500, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1251574240068756"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27009666222027386", "version": "1.0.5"}, "id": "1608946253514166", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26691746190486059", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27009666222027386"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1608946253514166"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_